<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">chrysalis-regeneration</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Chrysalis Regeneration</ansi> spell wraps a single target in deep Chrysalis
energy. It does not heal at once: every few moments it mends a good part
of the target's health, for a while. Cast it on yourself or a nearby ally.

It is the stronger form of <ansi fg="command">Vital Surge</ansi>, and it costs more to cast.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast chrysalis-regeneration [target]</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Help Single
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Vital
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 10
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 80
  <ansi fg="yellow">Healing:     </ansi> Strong, over a while

<ansi fg="white-bold">Notes:</ansi>
  - A target holds one healing spell at a time. A new one replaces the old.
  - Salves, potions and food that heal you still add on top.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help healing-spells</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help vital-surge</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help cast</ansi>
